            "code": "```java\npublic static InstructionHandle findHandle(final InstructionHandle[] ihs, final int[] pos, final int count, final int target)  {\n    if (ihs != null && pos != null)\n    {\n        int l = 0;\n        int r = count - 1;\n        /* * Do a binary search since the pos array is orderd. */ do\n        {\n            final int i = l + r >>> 1;\n            final int j = pos[i];\n            if (j == target)\n            {\n                return ihs[i];\n            }\n            if (target < j)\n            {\n                r = i - 1;\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                l = i + 1;\n            }\n        }\n        while (l <= r);\n    }\n    return null;\n}\n```"
