            "is_getter_or_setter": false,
            "code": "```java\nprivate A renderWrappedTextBlock(final A appendable, final int width, final int nextLineTabStop, final String text)  {\n    try\n    {\n        final BufferedReader in = new BufferedReader(new StringReader(text));\n        String line;\n        boolean firstLine = true;\n        while ((line = in.readLine()) != null)\n        {\n            if (!firstLine)\n            {\n                appendable.append(getNewLine());\n            }\n            else\n            {\n                firstLine = false;\n            }\n            appendWrappedText(appendable, width, nextLineTabStop, line);\n        }\n    }\n    catch (final IOException e)\n    {\n        // NOPMD // cannot happen\n    }\n    return appendable;\n}\n```"
